{"availability":"available","full":"bivysh/bivy","name":"bivy","description":"Run Claude Code, Codex, and other coding agents on your own machines—from your phone, browser, or automations. Open-source and self-hostable.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":2,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-21T08:04:56Z","updated":"2026-10-04T05:17:51Z","license":"AGPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://bivy.sh","topics":["ai-agents","automation","claude-code","codex","coding-agent","developer-tools","opencode","remote-development","self-hosted"],"demo":null,"color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T06:12:26.573Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T06:12:26.573Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-04T06:12:26.573Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T06:12:26.573Z","discoveredVia":[],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T10:38:43.329Z","stars":2,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-04T06:12:26.573Z","stars":2,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Local coding agents that show their work. Anywhere.","Bivy is the open-source workspace for coding agents. It runs Claude Code, Codex, Pi, OpenCode and other agents on your own machine. Reach them from a browser or your phone, with the live session, its terminal, its approvals, and the app they're building right in the chat. Try it, mark what's wrong, and send it back.","Bivy is not another coding agent and not a cloud development machine. The agent stays local and does the coding with your model provider. Your repos, tools, databases, and services stay where they are. Bivy gives you remote access to all of it, plus live previews, automations, and review."],"features":["Live previews. The running app beside the chat. Mark it, send it back,","Automations. GitHub issues, failed CI, Linear, Slack, schedules, and","Any agent. Hit a usage limit? Fork the session to another agent, or let","Your machine, anywhere. Start at your desk, pick the session up on your"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.co